    "notes": [
      "Starts with no GEM_HOME or GEM_PATH: bundler/setup finds the gems through BUNDLE_GEMFILE and .bundle/config.",
      "The project .rubocop.yml applied: v2's \"double\" was not flagged, v3's 'ok' was (Style/StringLiterals).",
      "Nothing written to the project (Gemfile.lock unchanged) or HOME."
